      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    current_value_before_fees = 320.0\n    management_fee_rate = 0.02\n    performance_fee_rate = 0.30\n    previous_high_water_mark = 350.0 * (1 + 0.20)\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    management_fee = current_value_before_fees * management_fee_rate\n\n    # The current value is below the high water mark, so no incentive fee applies.\n    performance_fee = 0.0\n    ending_capital_position = (\n        current_value_before_fees - management_fee - performance_fee\n    )\n\n    # Return answer in millions of dollars to one decimal place\n    return round(ending_capital_position, 1)\n```",
